[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments/273661656","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/537#issuecomment-273661656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/537","id":273661656,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MzY2MTY1Ng==","user":{"login":"alexkaratarakis","id":128712,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODcxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis","html_url":"https://github.com/alexkaratarakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-01-19T02:08:03Z","updated_at":"2017-01-19T02:08:03Z","body":"This works for me. Just to be sure, can you (re)try with the following steps:\r\n1) `git pull` to get the latest version\r\n2) Run `scripts\\bootstrap.ps1` again. \r\n3) Use `vcpkg version` to verify that you have at least version v0.0.67. \r\n4) `vcpkg remove --purge glbinding:x64-windows`\r\n5) `vcpkg install glbinding:x64-windows`\r\n\r\nThese executables never get built for me, so this is somewhat odd (as opposed to having them build, and then the portfile removes them afterwards, which is prone to race issues if the build does something weird). ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reaction